---

<section class="sec s-night">
  <div class="halftone" style="--hx:90%;--hy:10%;--hx2:5%;--hy2:90%"></div><div class="leak l-blue" style="left:60%;top:10%;width:50vw;height:50vw"></div><div class="grainy"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="slug"><b>04</b><span>Day by day</span><span class="ln"></span><span class="m hide-s">Follows the official schedule</span></p>
    <div class="split end">
      <h2 class="d-l" data-split>The plan, <span class="it">roughly</span></h2>
      <div><div class="tabs" role="tablist" data-tabs aria-label="Itinerary length"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-show="4">4 days</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-show="6">6 days</button></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="acc mt-48"><div class="acc-item open" data-only="all">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="day-0"><span class="n">DAY 01</span><span class="t">Gates open</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="day-0"><div><div class="acc-body"><div class="slot"><b>Morning</b><span>Picked up from the airport or railway station, room check in, phones on charge, outfits negotiated</span></div><div class="slot"><b>Afternoon</b><span>Lunch and the briefing, faces to names and one rule, nobody walks back alone, then through the IIT Bombay gate</span></div><div class="slot"><b>Night</b><span>First lap of the campus, then night one of Mood Indigo as per the official schedule, dinner included</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-only="all">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="day-1"><span class="n">DAY 02</span><span class="t">Every stage, at once</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="day-1"><div><div class="acc-body"><div class="slot"><b>Morning</b><span>Breakfast, then competitions open, music, dance, drama, art and quizzing from colleges across India</span></div><div class="slot"><b>Afternoon</b><span>Workshops, lunch somewhere between two stages, informals and street acts</span></div><div class="slot"><b>Night</b><span>Proshows and the night’s main act, the Pronite if it’s on tonight’s official schedule</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-only="all">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="day-2"><span class="n">DAY 03</span><span class="t">Pick a side of campus</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="day-2"><div><div class="acc-body"><div class="slot"><b>Morning</b><span>Slow breakfast, nobody is judging the sunglasses indoors, then the installations</span></div><div class="slot"><b>Afternoon</b><span>Finals, workshops wrapping up, golden hour by the lake</span></div><div class="slot"><b>Night</b><span>Mood Indigo after dark, voice gone, new friends very much not</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-only="4">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="day-3"><span class="n">DAY 04</span><span class="t">Last lap, loudest night</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="day-3"><div><div class="acc-body"><div class="slot"><b>Morning</b><span>Breakfast and check out, bags go to the trip captain</span></div><div class="slot"><b>Afternoon</b><span>Final events, the last walk, one group photo of twenty people who were strangers on Day 01</span></div><div class="slot"><b>Night</b><span>The closing night, then dropped to the airport or railway station</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-only="6" hidden>
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="day-4"><span class="n">DAY 04</span><span class="t">Last lap, loudest night</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="day-4"><div><div class="acc-body"><div class="slot"><b>Morning</b><span>A slow morning, the room stays, you’re not going anywhere yet</span></div><div class="slot"><b>Afternoon</b><span>Final events, the last walk and the group photo</span></div><div class="slot"><b>Night</b><span>The closing night, then back to the room, tomorrow the city</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-only="6" hidden>
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="day-5"><span class="n">DAY 05</span><span class="t">Gateway to the necklace</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="day-5"><div><div class="acc-body"><div class="slot"><b>Morning</b><span>9 AM from IIT Bombay to the Gateway of India, then the ferry to Elephanta</span></div><div class="slot"><b>Afternoon</b><span>The caves, the ferry back, lunch and Colaba Causeway, bargain like you mean it</span></div><div class="slot"><b>Evening</b><span>Gateway at golden hour, then Marine Drive as the Queen’s Necklace switches on, dinner in the city</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-only="6" hidden>
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="day-6"><span class="n">DAY 06</span><span class="t">One last day out west</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="day-6"><div><div class="acc-body"><div class="slot"><b>Morning</b><span>Check out, Galaxy Apartments, then Mannat at Bandstand, everyone takes the photo, including us</span></div><div class="slot"><b>Afternoon</b><span>Bandra Fort, old Bandra on foot, lunch in Juhu and the beach</span></div><div class="slot"><b>Evening</b><span>Jio World Drive and an early dinner, 6 PM drop to the airport or railway station</span></div></div></div></div></div></div>
    <p class="fine mt-24">Programme, venues and timings follow the official Mood Indigo schedule, if it moves, the plan moves with it and the crew chat hears first</p>
  </div>
</section>
